        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8aa40b44-9dd2-36f3-a953-a1478156541c",
                "word": "déroutant",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "a882b0c4-482e-45c2-a8c9-fd5e3b19db7d",
                        "entry_id": "8aa40b44-9dd2-36f3-a953-a1478156541c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "form": "déroutants"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a8becbab-1364-4aa1-a2ad-d611f7508b49",
                        "entry_id": "8aa40b44-9dd2-36f3-a953-a1478156541c",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "déroutante"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "7ded0468-a0f6-40d4-b94c-5f512ea09d7a",
                        "entry_id": "8aa40b44-9dd2-36f3-a953-a1478156541c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "déroutantes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cbb87b7a-6737-3f50-8f33-cea400a5a00f",
                        "entry_id": "8aa40b44-9dd2-36f3-a953-a1478156541c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui déroute, qui déconcerte."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "782772ed-38c3-425f-aaa6-169872c39332",
                                "sense_id": "cbb87b7a-6737-3f50-8f33-cea400a5a00f",
                                "text": "Et plus déroutante encore est cette certitude que tout se déroulera entre nous sans raisonnement et sans préméditation, pas un instant je ne me demande comment agir pour la gagner ou ne pas la perdre, je ne fais que vaciller en moi et tomber lentement en elle, délogifié, dénervé, désarmé, aspiré par le fluide et la fluidité qui se dégagent de son regard, de sa chair, de ses phrases, de son sourire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e579655-598a-4db3-a64d-de4ee93718ef",
                                "sense_id": "cbb87b7a-6737-3f50-8f33-cea400a5a00f",
                                "text": "La neige en mai n’est pas non plus déroutante, ni Archimède faisant de la géométrie pendant le siège de Syracuse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93187ea4-72ae-41ca-805d-e2fcdc6c38a9",
                                "sense_id": "cbb87b7a-6737-3f50-8f33-cea400a5a00f",
                                "text": "Déroutante Perse, si immuable dans ses convulsions, si elle-même à travers tant de métamorphoses !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3428cac-30a8-4f74-8be2-f6253f4b6adf",
                                "sense_id": "cbb87b7a-6737-3f50-8f33-cea400a5a00f",
                                "text": "On arrive à se demander quels principes guident les choix du premier ministre François Legault et les dirigeants de la santé, que tant de gens ont décriés comme étant déroutants, contradictoires et manquant de raisonnement scientifique."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8174c0d7-6bec-44bf-8d56-9a47e288c504",
                        "source_entry_id": "8aa40b44-9dd2-36f3-a953-a1478156541c",
                        "source_sense_id": "cbb87b7a-6737-3f50-8f33-cea400a5a00f",
                        "target_lang_word": "uncanny",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "uncanny",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24b4d6bb-c829-3086-8390-b006c100b2c3",
                                        "entry_id": "8719d0fc-0799-3f13-b636-fba8163c13cc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Strange, and mysteriously unsettling (as if supernatural); weird."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9373042c-02ce-46fa-8b79-7fd5a6808bf6",
                                                "sense_id": "24b4d6bb-c829-3086-8390-b006c100b2c3",
                                                "text": "He bore an uncanny resemblance to the dead sailor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08506927-d919-4e45-9ce4-15b58d75b157",
                                                "sense_id": "24b4d6bb-c829-3086-8390-b006c100b2c3",
                                                "text": "An eerie feeling came over me. She seemed uncanny and fateful."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0299b90-ce0c-46a0-b95c-6c1e32814709",
                                                "sense_id": "24b4d6bb-c829-3086-8390-b006c100b2c3",
                                                "text": "These men had some uncanny knack of knowing when the steel was right, and like many such things, it just could not be put into a textbook on the subject."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdeb03c4-3aa1-4096-a5e1-5d339290eaa7",
                                                "sense_id": "24b4d6bb-c829-3086-8390-b006c100b2c3",
                                                "text": "The new iPhone promises “next level” photography with push-button ease. But the results look odd and uncanny."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "768a3677-407e-3b8b-ae32-085da0851f6a",
                                        "entry_id": "8719d0fc-0799-3f13-b636-fba8163c13cc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Careless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "dialectal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "uncanny",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5bba0db-c056-35fe-af9e-bc80cef24610",
                                        "entry_id": "e22cf679-e4ae-3a75-8598-48eb42f7a9e9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that is simultaneously familiar and strange, typically leading to feelings of discomfort."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26ddf93b-5599-4a73-93d6-f3cc3fc5c5a7",
                                                "sense_id": "b5bba0db-c056-35fe-af9e-bc80cef24610",
                                                "text": "This uncontrollable possibility—the possibility of a certain loss of control—can, perhaps, explain why the uncanny remains a marginal notion even within psychoanalysis itself."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f11b2d2-388d-48a5-bf27-a4c9d8931251",
                                                "sense_id": "b5bba0db-c056-35fe-af9e-bc80cef24610",
                                                "text": "As is well known, Freud introduced the concept of the uncanny into psychoanalysis in 1919 and used The Sandman as a prime illustration for his definition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99b17cee-9b2d-4874-8dc4-32d4d83f8d5f",
                                                "sense_id": "b5bba0db-c056-35fe-af9e-bc80cef24610",
                                                "text": "In the preceding chapter, we saw that Freud linked the maternal body, death, and the afterlife with the uncanny in his famous essay \"The Uncanny\" (\"Das Unheimliche\")."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61de862a-a3d1-4e26-be8f-76fb8f07f11d",
                                                "sense_id": "b5bba0db-c056-35fe-af9e-bc80cef24610",
                                                "text": "The uncanny involves feelings of uncertainty, in particular regarding the reality of who one is and what is being experienced."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b26f6cb8-f393-4cbf-9e50-8cb932d9c2bd",
                                                "sense_id": "b5bba0db-c056-35fe-af9e-bc80cef24610",
                                                "text": "Freud argued that the uncanny was particularly associated with feelings of horror aroused by the figure of the paternal castrator, neglecting the tropes of woman and animal as a source of the uncanny."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "008ce882-2eac-45fb-bc7c-04cc8734fb28",
                                                "sense_id": "b5bba0db-c056-35fe-af9e-bc80cef24610",
                                                "text": "[The uncanny is] something that was long familiar to the psyche and was estranged from it only through being repressed. The link with repression now illuminates Schelling′s definition of the uncanny as ‘something that should have remained hidden and has come into the open.’ (Freud: 2003, 147 f)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79a70bf8-6a03-4cfe-b094-32c5143babef",
                                                "sense_id": "b5bba0db-c056-35fe-af9e-bc80cef24610",
                                                "text": "Because the uncanny affects and haunts everything, it is in constant transformation and cannot be pinned down."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8c3e013-073c-4d32-abb6-4fdae4edd38f",
                        "source_entry_id": "8aa40b44-9dd2-36f3-a953-a1478156541c",
